  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Import contacts\"\nslug: \"/apps/android-import-contacts--twt6kz5lgz19ekqy8mwn6zz2\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Android\",\"General\",\"android\",\"import\",\"working-with-contacts\"]\n---\n\nTo import a contact from your Android device into the mobile app:\n\n1. Tap on the ‘**Phone**’ icon in the ’**Contacts**’ tab.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/4fbd3e285f6d41728906/3d34f6b85473986a15e542d1247bc15ec2808ea7ece2be3f4177325c4d4cf756.png)\n\n1. Tap on the![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/91f055fa03b13c57b78c/cc539f3fb8944d128b72e89e7c5f787b1b3a7f7250d2bd692b7edc154405e6d3.png)icon to select the contacts you want to import.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/dd83ceb4698f526a5a85/562259591efcc28b498545002db02d233fa7b9f3e9f49855272e1078ec0b7bfe.png)\n\n1. Select the contacts you would like to import and press the ‘**Done**’ button to finish importing.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/dd2e1680114ac3d62aee/5b703a6e7ab8d755b0f1f547683abd6b4ae80c05533fd83bb79ccb9cd119ec30.png)\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Dial a contact from a device’s phone book](/docs/apps/android-dial-from-phone-book--bgh7hvr47y6wx203k9w62tja)\n- [Working with contacts](/docs/apps/android-working-with-contact--ukprk9ontafcdkvwcit3mzs6)\n"
